#. module: axoline_layout_editor
#: model:axoline.layout.template,description:axoline_layout_editor.template_classic
msgid ""
"Traditional layout with logo on the left, address block, two-column info "
"table, and line items table."
msgstr ""
"Traditionelles Layout mit Logo links, Adressblock, zweispaltiger "
"Info-Tabelle und Positionstabelle."

#. module: axoline_layout_editor
#: model:axoline.layout.template,description:axoline_layout_editor.template_modern
msgid ""
"Modern layout with logo at the top, compact sender line, and two-column "
"header for address and company details."
msgstr ""
"Modernes Layout mit Logo oben, kompakter Briefkopfzeile und "
"Zwei-Spalten-Aufbau für Adresse und Firmendaten."

#. module: axoline_layout_editor
#: model:axoline.layout.template,description:axoline_layout_editor.template_compact
msgid ""
"Minimalistic layout with logo on the right, single-column info table, and "
"reduced header area."
msgstr ""
"Minimalistisches Layout mit Logo rechts, einspaltiger Info-Tabelle und "
"reduziertem Kopfbereich."

#. module: axoline_layout_editor
#: model:axoline.layout.template,description:axoline_layout_editor.template_letterhead
msgid ""
"Professional letterhead layout with logo at the top, sender line, two-column "
"header (address and company details), info table, and free text area."
msgstr ""
"Professionelles Briefpapier-Layout mit Logo oben, Absenderzeile, "
"Zwei-Spalten-Kopf (Adresse und Firmendaten), Infotabelle und Freitext-"
"Bereich."

